description:
•	Produce draft periodic risk assessment reports on each identified risks such as credit, liquidity, foreign exchange, interest rate, operational, strategic and other risks with sound conclusion and recommendation;
•	Ascertain that risk data captured from different units of the Bank are complete, timely, accurate and relevant to conduct analysis and draw conclusions;
•	Monitor internal and external changes that are reasonably considered to bear impact on risk profile of the Bank such as regulatory, industry, sector…etc.;
•	Conduct ad hoc or special risk assessments on businesses lines or selected type of risks such as operational and credit risks;
•	Participate in revision of policies, procedures, guidelines and the Risk Management Program;
•	Performs other related duties as required.
